  "overview": "Hanford CA PD uses Flock Safety technology to capture objective evidence without compromising on individual privacy. Hanford CA PD utilizes retroactive search to solve crimes after they've occurred. Additionally, Hanford CA PD utilizes real time alerting of hotlist vehicles to capture wanted criminals. In an effort to ensure proper usage and guardrails are in place, they have made the below policies and usage statistics available to the public.\n\nCommunity Impact\nIn the California News\nOAKLAND, CA\n6/24/2026\n\nHOMICIDE / MURDER\n\nFlock LPR Aids Oakland Homicide Investigation After Daylight Shooting\nLPR\nRead full story\nSIMI VALLEY, CA\n6/21/2026\n\nSTOLEN VEHICLE RECOVERY\n\nFlock LPR Helps Recover Stolen Vehicle Same Day in Simi Valley\nLPR\nRead full story\nROHNERT PARK, CA\n6/15/2026\n\nSTOLEN VEHICLE RECOVERY\n\nFlock LPR Alert Leads to Stolen Jeep Recovery and Two Arrests in Rohnert Park\nLPR\nRead full story\nSALINAS, CA\n6/11/2026\n\nBURGLARY / BREAKING & ENTERING\n\nFlock LPR Helps Identify Suspect in $50K+ Copper Wire Theft in Monterey County\nLPR\nRead full story\nBISHOP, CA\n6/10/2026\n\nKIDNAPPING / ABDUCTION\n\nFlock Safety Camera Aids Kidnapping Investigation in Bishop, CA\nVIDEO\nRead full story\nData & Usage Summary\nCamera Alert Activity\n\nCamera alerts by source and topic over the last 30 days.\n\n320 alerts\nCalifornia SVS - Stolen Plate\n313\nCalifornia SVS - Stolen Vehicle\n6\nCalifornia SVS - Felony Vehicles\n1",
